  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Kongsberg Defence and Aerospace As has $641M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Kongsberg Defence and Aerospace As won 111 awards this period, with an average award size of $5.8M. Kongsberg Defence and Aerospace As's obligations are down 24.4% year over year. The Department of Defense obligated $641M to Kongsberg Defence and Aerospace As in FY2026 to date. The Department of the Interior obligated $765 to Kongsberg Defence and Aerospace As in FY2026 to date. Guided Missile and Space Vehicle Propulsion Unit and Propulsion Unit Parts Manufacturing is the largest NAICS market for Kongsberg Defence and Aerospace As at $286M, followed by Search, Detection, Navigation, Guidance, Aeronautical, and Nautical System and Instrument Manufacturing at $222M, and Military Armored Vehicle, Tank, and Tank Component Manufacturing at $112M. Fiscal-year obligations for Kongsberg Defence and Aerospace As were $135M in FY21, $94.8M in FY22, $262M in FY23, $208M in FY24, $847M in FY25, and $641M in FY26 to date.",
